# Adapty

> Adapty is a revenue management platform for mobile in-app purchases and subscriptions: SDKs for iOS, Android, Flutter, React Native, and Unity, a no-code paywall builder, A/B testing, subscription analytics, and integrations with major analytics and attribution tools. Trusted by 20,000+ apps.

